    "body": "Yup, in addition to the very trivial centering you can with `display:grid` or `flex`, `display:block` works just fine now too:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<div>foo</div>\n<style>\nhtml, body { padding: 0; margin: 0; height: 100%; align-content: center; justify-items: center; }\ndiv { width: 100px; height: 100px; border: thick dotted;}\n</style>\n```\n\nWe can go ahead and close this.",
