    "updated_at": "2026-03-25T00:59:17Z",
    "body": "> `display:block` works just fine now too\n\nOnly in Chrome, though, so I understand the frustration. But yeah the conclusion should be to ask Firefox and Safari to implement `justify-self` on block-levels, not to restore `<center>`.",
